ents are attached to the namespace."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the tracker is removed or the app relaunched with a different namespace, those events can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be sent to the collector and they remain in a zombie state inside the EventStore."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To remove all the zombie events you can call an internal method "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"removeUnsentEventsExceptForNamespaces"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SPSQLEventStore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which will delete all the EventStores instanced with namespaces not listed in the passed list."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker","title":"SnowplowTracker","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[]},"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/Snowplow":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Entry point to instance a new Snowplow tracker."}],"title":"Snowplow","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/snowplow","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Snowplow","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Snowplow","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/Snowplow/createTracker(namespace:network:_:)":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/snowplow\/createtracker(namespace:network:_:)","title":"createTracker(namespace:network:_:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a new tracker instance which will be used inside the app to track events."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "